Scoped Berkeley/IRCAM/CARL Sound Format

The tag tables, magic/endianness table, probe heads, header parsing and
1024-byte data offset in src/ircam.ts follow libavformat/ircam.c,
ircam.h, ircamdec.c (ircam_probe, ircam_read_header) and ircamenc.c
(ircam_write_header). The packet span follows libavformat/pcm.c
(ff_pcm_default_packet_size) and the output rate word follows
libavutil/rational.c (av_q2intfloat).
